{
  "id": 538,
  "title": "如何理解系统集成以及特点",
  "date": "2024-01-11",
  "summary": "系统集成取代了传统的管理模式，打破了信息岛，实现了管理的系统化和集成。系统集成建设过程中涉及的设备、软硬件较多。为了达到统一分配管理的目的，需要利用技术手段整合资源和数据处理。系统兼容性，即系统集成，比弱电工程复杂得多。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-538.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-1-11/20241111357505114.jpg",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">系统集成，从字面意义上理解，是将分散和独立的功能部分集成为一个统一的系统。系统集成也可以理解为安全系统、中央空调系统、给排水系统、消防系统、照明系统、机电系统等专业子系统的重要控制技术。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">系统集成可以实现各相对独立运行系统的集中控制，包括建筑中的弱电子系统和重要运行系统，最终实现各单个系统之间的信息共享。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">系统集成取代了传统的管理模式，打破了信息岛，实现了管理的系统化和集成。系统集成建设过程中涉及的设备、软硬件较多。为了达到统一分配管理的目的，需要利用技术手段整合资源和数据处理。系统兼容性，即系统集成，比弱电工程复杂得多。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">除了强大的控制功能外，系统集成的关键软件技术和硬件配置以及独立系统之间的信息传输和共享也是系统集成正常运行的重要基础。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">系统集成的特点：</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">1、系统集成应以满足用户需求为基础，满足客户实际应用的要求。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">二、系统集成要满足客户的需求，选择优质的产品和优秀的技术。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">3、系统集成体现了更多的设计、调试和开发技术和能力。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">4、系统集成包括技术、管理和业务，是一个综合性的系统工程。技术是系统集成的核心，管理和业务活动是系统集成项目成功实施的可靠保障。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">5、性能性价比是评价系统集成项目设计是否合理、实施是否成功的重要参考因素。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">简而言之，系统集成是整合各系统、设备和功能的技术行为和管理行为。最终实现统一控制和数据共享。</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-1-11/20241111358445578.jpg\" title=\"11\" alt=\"11\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></p>",
